; Survex entry that cavern reads with many warnings and then fails on.
; Every leg's compass reading of 400 draws a "Suspicious compass reading"
; warning (72 legs, 72 warnings), and the trailing *include names a file
; that does not exist, so cavern exits with an error after the warnings.
; Drives the Cavern page regression: the failed harvest's error is the
; whole cavern log, warnings included.
*begin NoisyFailure
*fix S0 0 0 0
*data normal from to tape compass clino
S0 S1 5.0 400 0
S1 S2 5.0 400 0
S2 S3 5.0 400 0
S3 S4 5.0 400 0
S4 S5 5.0 400 0
S5 S6 5.0 400 0
S6 S7 5.0 400 0
S7 S8 5.0 400 0
S8 S9 5.0 400 0
S9 S10 5.0 400 0
S10 S11 5.0 400 0
S11 S12 5.0 400 0
S12 S13 5.0 400 0
S13 S14 5.0 400 0
S14 S15 5.0 400 0
S15 S16 5.0 400 0
S16 S17 5.0 400 0
S17 S18 5.0 400 0
S18 S19 5.0 400 0
S19 S20 5.0 400 0
S20 S21 5.0 400 0
S21 S22 5.0 400 0
S22 S23 5.0 400 0
S23 S24 5.0 400 0
S24 S25 5.0 400 0
S25 S26 5.0 400 0
S26 S27 5.0 400 0
S27 S28 5.0 400 0
S28 S29 5.0 400 0
S29 S30 5.0 400 0
S30 S31 5.0 400 0
S31 S32 5.0 400 0
